msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non, c’est juste... ⟪k:1⟫je sais pas... ⟪k:2⟫je suis juste... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫curieux⟪k:5⟫. C’est "
"tout."

#: scenario9:scenario9_9B1D904F_C8CD_4E11_8E5B_48A0C42A2384
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd5c15379773363a9d479728b4a5777895e9e261af21c873a505e5457eb311d6
